BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:living-room-20261118T181500-national-theatre-live-les-liaisons-dangereu
 ses-2026@small-screens-pdx
DTSTAMP:20261115T095407Z
DTSTART:20261119T021500Z
DTEND:20261119T051400Z
SUMMARY:National Theatre Live: Les Liaisons Dangereuses (2026)
LOCATION:Living Room Theaters\, 341 SW 10th Ave\, Portland OR
GEO:45.5215;-122.6826
DESCRIPTION:Dir. Marianne Elliott · 179 min\n\nA new staging of Christophe
 r Hampton's celebrated adaptation of the classic novel\, where among the g
 littering salons of the super-rich\, one misstep can mean ruin. Marquise d
 e Merteuil is a master in the art of survival. Alongside the magnetic Vico
 mte de Valmont\, they turn seduction into strategy and weaponise desire. B
 ut when their alliance collapses into rivalry\, the battle between them th
 reatens to destroy everyone in their path. Filmed live at the National The
 atre\, Marianne Elliott directs this thrilling game of love\, lies\, and s
 ocial warfare.\n\nTickets: https://pdx.livingroomtheaters.com/purchase/nat
 ional-theatre-live-les-liaisons-dangereuses?showingId=4124426\n\nMore show
 times: https://mattlohkamp.github.io/small-screens-pdx/
URL:https://pdx.livingroomtheaters.com/purchase/national-theatre-live-les-l
 iaisons-dangereuses?showingId=4124426
END:VEVENT
